喝|to drink|喝水|hēshuǐ|to drink water|请多喝一点儿热水。|Qǐng duō hē yìdiǎnr rèshuǐ.|Please drink a little more warm water.|An open mouth (口) craving (曷) a refreshing drink when thirsty.
回|to return; to go back; to reply|回家|huíjiā|to go home|你今天几点回家？|Nǐ jīntiān jǐ diǎn huíjiā?|What time are you going home today?|An outer loop circling around an inner square, spiraling back to where it started.
块|piece; lump; yuan (spoken)|一块钱|yí kuài qián|one yuan; one dollar|这个苹果三块钱。|Zhège píngguǒ sān kuài qián.|This apple costs three yuan.|A clod of earth (土) broken off cleanly into a solid piece (夬).
师|teacher; master; specialist|老师|lǎoshī|teacher|王老师教我们汉字。|Wáng lǎoshī jiāo wǒmen Hànzì.|Teacher Wang teaches us Chinese characters.|A leader standing under a banner to guide and instruct everyone.
老|old; experienced; always|老师|lǎoshī|teacher|这棵树已经很老了。|Zhè kē shù yǐjīng hěn lǎo le.|This tree is already very old.|An elder with long hair leaning on a walking cane (匕).
冷|cold; chilly|很冷|hěn lěng|very cold|今天外面很冷，多穿点衣服。|Jīntiān wàimiàn hěn lěng, duō chuān diǎn yīfu.|It is very cold outside today; wear more clothes.|Two sharp icicles (冫) commanding (令) you to bundle up against the chill.
买|to buy; to purchase|买东西|mǎi dōngxi|to go shopping; to buy things|我去商店买一点儿水果。|Wǒ qù shāngdiàn mǎi yìdiǎnr shuǐguǒ.|I am going to the store to buy some fruit.|Tying a bundle with a top hook over your head (头) after buying goods at the market.
猫|cat|小猫|xiǎomāo|kitten; little cat|小猫正在椅子上睡觉。|Xiǎomāo zhèngzài yǐzi shàng shuìjiào.|The little cat is sleeping on the chair.|A nimble animal (犭) stalking softly through the grassy seedlings (苗).
关|to close; to turn off; relation|没关系|méi guānxi|it doesn't matter; never mind|对不起！——没关系。|Duìbuqǐ! — Méi guānxi.|I'm sorry! — It doesn't matter.|Two crossbar bolts sliding across the sky gate to shut it tight.
系|system; connection; to tie|关系|guānxi|relationship; connection|他们两个人的关系很好。|Tāmen liǎng gè rén de guānxi hěn hǎo.|The relationship between the two of them is very good.|Fine silk threads (糸) twisted together under a leading stroke to tie a connection.
米|rice; meter|米饭|mǐfàn|cooked rice|我晚饭想吃米饭。|Wǒ wǎnfàn xiǎng chī mǐfàn.|I would like to eat rice for dinner.|Grains of rice scattered evenly on all four sides of a threshing cross.
呢|question particle (and you?; where?)|你呢|nǐ ne|how about you?; and you?|我很好，你呢？|Wǒ hěn hǎo, nǐ ne?|I am doing well, how about you?|A gentle mouth (口) leaning close like a nun (尼) to ask "and what about you?".
能|can; be able to; capable|不能|bù néng|cannot; must not|明天你能来我家吗？|Míngtiān nǐ néng lái wǒ jiā ma?|Can you come to my house tomorrow?|A strong bear with sturdy flesh (月) and powerful paws (匕) capable of anything.
亮|bright; light; shiny|漂亮|piàoliang|pretty; beautiful|今天晚上的月亮真亮。|Jīntiān wǎnshang de yuèliang zhēn liàng.|The moon tonight is really bright.|A high pavilion roof (亠) standing tall above open legs, shining brightly from afar.
漂|pretty (in 漂亮); to float|漂亮|piàoliang|pretty; beautiful|她今天穿的裙子很漂亮。|Tā jīntiān chuān de qúnzi hěn piàoliang.|The dress she is wearing today is very pretty.|Clear water (氵) reflecting a colorful ticket (票) floating gracefully on the surface.
苹|apple (in 苹果); duckweed|苹果|píngguǒ|apple|桌子上有一个红苹果。|Zhuōzi shàng yǒu yí gè hóng píngguǒ.|There is a red apple on the table.|A green plant (艹) growing peacefully (平) in the orchard to bear crisp apples.
前|front; forward; before; ago|前面|qiánmiàn|in front; ahead|前面那个人是谁？|Qiánmiàn nàge rén shì shuí?|Who is that person in front?|A boat (月) trimming its sails (刂) to glide straight ahead.
热|hot; warm; to heat up|很热|hěn rè|very hot|夏天北京的天气很热。|Xiàtiān Běijīng de tiānqì hěn rè.|The weather in Beijing is very hot in summer.|Four roaring flames (灬) burning underneath a hand holding something aloft.
认|to recognize; to know; to admit|认识|rènshi|to know; to recognize|我认识这位中文老师。|Wǒ rènshi zhè wèi Zhōngwén lǎoshī.|I know this Chinese teacher.|Speaking words (讠) with a patient person (人) until you truly know each other.
识|to know; knowledge; to recognize|认识|rènshi|to know; to be acquainted with|很高兴认识大家。|Hěn gāoxìng rènshi dàjiā.|Very nice to meet everyone.|Words (讠) spoken by a single mouth (只) that carry lasting knowledge.
商|commerce; business; merchant|商店|shāngdiàn|shop; store|学校旁边有一家商店。|Xuéxiào pángbiān yǒu yì jiā shāngdiàn.|There is a store next to the school.|Merchants talking (口) under a market stall roof to discuss trade and prices.
谁|who; whom|是谁|shì shuí|who is it|请问你在找谁？|Qǐngwèn nǐ zài zhǎo shuí?|May I ask who you are looking for?|Using words (讠) to ask which bird (隹) perched on the branch is calling out.
太|too; extremely; very|太好了|tài hǎo le|great!; wonderful!|这个箱子太重了。|Zhè ge xiāngzi tài zhòng le.|This suitcase is too heavy.|Something already big (大) with an extra dot added underneath to mean "even more / too much".
喂|hello (on the phone); to feed|喂，你好|wéi, nǐ hǎo|hello (answering phone)|喂，请问是张先生吗？|Wéi, qǐngwèn shì Zhāng xiānsheng ma?|Hello, may I ask if this is Mr. Zhang?|A mouth (口) calling out across the field (田) to get someone's attention on the phone.
喜|to like; happy; joyful celebration|喜欢|xǐhuan|to like; to be fond of|你喜欢喝咖啡还是喝茶？|Nǐ xǐhuan hē kāfēi háishi hē chá?|Do you like drinking coffee or tea?|Beating a festive drum (壴) above a smiling mouth (口) in joyful celebration.
先|first; before; Mr. (in 先生)|先生|xiānsheng|Mr.; sir; husband|李先生今天不在办公室。|Lǐ xiānsheng jīntiān bú zài bàngōngshì.|Mr. Li is not in the office today.|Two walking legs (儿) striding out ahead of the ground (土) to go first.
想|to want; to think; to miss|想吃|xiǎng chī|want to eat|我想去中国旅游。|Wǒ xiǎng qù Zhōngguó lǚyóu.|I want to travel to China.|Looking at a tree with your eye (相) while holding the image in your heart (心).
谢|to thank; to apologize|谢谢|xièxie|thank you|谢谢你的帮助！|Xièxie nǐ de bāngzhù!|Thank you for your help!|Polite words (讠) spoken with a bow of the body (身) measured to the inch (寸).
校|school; campus; to proofread|学校|xuéxiào|school|我们的学校有很多学生。|Wǒmen de xuéxiào yǒu hěn duō xuésheng.|Our school has many students.|Tall trees (木) lining the paths where students cross (交) and learn together.
服|clothes; to serve; to convince|衣服|yīfu|clothes; clothing|这件衣服的颜色很好看。|Zhè jiàn yīfu de yánsè hěn hǎokàn.|The color of this piece of clothing looks very nice.|Fitting a garment neatly to the body (月) with a steady hand (又).
衣|clothes; coat; garment|大衣|dàyī|overcoat|冬天要穿暖和的衣服。|Dōngtiān yào chuān nuǎnhuo de yīfu.|In winter you should wear warm clothes.|A collar at the top and flowing sleeves and robe folds hanging down below.
椅|chair|椅子|yǐzi|chair|请坐在那把椅子上。|Qǐng zuò zài nà bǎ yǐzi shàng.|Please sit on that chair.|A sturdy wooden (木) frame that is wonderfully (奇) comfortable to lean on.
样|appearance; shape; kind; sample|怎么样|zěnmeyàng|how is it?; how about?|这本书怎么样？|Zhè běn shū zěnmeyàng?|How is this book?|A wooden (木) mold carved in the shape of a sheep (羊) to set a standard pattern.
住|to live; to stay; to reside|住在|zhù zài|to live in/at|我住在北京。|Wǒ zhù zài Běijīng.|I live in Beijing.|A person (亻) who becomes the master (主) of a house settles down to live there.
桌|table; desk|桌子|zhuōzi|table; desk|桌子上放着一杯茶。|Zhuōzi shàng fàngzhe yì bēi chá.|There is a cup of tea sitting on the table.|A wooden (木) surface standing tall (卓) off the floor for eating and writing.
昨|yesterday|昨天|zuótiān|yesterday|昨天我去看了朋友。|Zuótiān wǒ qù kànle péngyou.|I went to visit a friend yesterday.|The sun (日) that just passed a moment ago (乍) is yesterday.
坐|to sit; to travel by|请坐|qǐng zuò|please have a seat|请进，请坐！|Qǐng jìn, qǐng zuò!|Please come in and have a seat!|Two people (人人) sitting balanced on the earth (土) side by side.
店|shop; store; inn|饭店|fàndiàn|restaurant; hotel|这家饭店的菜很好吃。|Zhè jiā fàndiàn de cài hěn hǎochī.|The food at this restaurant is very delicious.|A wide shelter (广) occupying (占) a busy street corner as a shop.
京|capital city; Beijing|北京|Běijīng|Beijing|北京是中国的首都。|Běijīng shì Zhōngguó de shǒudū.|Beijing is the capital of China.|A grand palace gate tower rising high above the heart of the capital city.
要|to want; will; important|需要|xūyào|to need|我要一杯热咖啡。|Wǒ yào yì bēi rè kāfēi.|I would like a cup of hot coffee.|A woman (女) reaching with both hands under a cover (覀) for what she truly wants.
间|room; between; space|房间|fángjiān|room|这个房间非常干净。|Zhè ge fángjiān fēicháng gānjìng.|This room is very clean.|Bright sunlight (日) shining right through the gap between two doors (门).
日|sun; day; date|日本|Rìběn|Japan|今天是几月几日？|Jīntiān shì jǐ yuè jǐ rì?|What month and day is it today?|A framed window capturing the bright orb of the sun with a ray in the center.
百|hundred|一百|yìbǎi|one hundred|这件衬衫一百块钱。|Zhè jiàn chènshān yìbǎi kuài qián.|This shirt costs one hundred yuan.|One (一) horizontal bar placed atop white (白) to mark a full hundred.
哥|older brother|哥哥|gēge|older brother|我哥哥比我大三岁。|Wǒ gēge bǐ wǒ dà sān suì.|My older brother is three years older than me.|Two "can" components (可) stacked tall, like an older brother you can always rely on.
还|still; also; yet|还有|háiyǒu|still have; in addition|你还要别的吗？|Nǐ hái yào bié de ma?|Do you want anything else?|Walking (辶) forward even when someone says "no" (不), continuing on still.
以|by means of; in order to; according to|可以|kěyǐ|can; may; okay|我可以坐在这里吗？|Wǒ kěyǐ zuò zài zhèlǐ ma?|May I sit right here?|A person (人) carrying a tool by their side to get something done.
可|can; may; able to; approve|可以|kěyǐ|can; may|今天下午我们可以去游泳。|Jīntiān xiàwǔ wǒmen kěyǐ qù yóuyǒng.|We can go swimming this afternoon.|An open mouth (口) letting out a smooth breath of approval: "yes, you can".
口|mouth; opening; measure word for family|人口|rénkǒu|population|我们家有四口人。|Wǒmen jiā yǒu sì kǒu rén.|There are four people in our family.|A simple square outline picturing an open mouth ready to speak or eat.
两|two (used before measure words)|两个|liǎng gè|two (items)|我有两个好朋友。|Wǒ yǒu liǎng gè hǎo péngyou.|I have two good friends.|Two people standing side by side in balance under one shared frame.
也|also; too; either|也是|yě shì|also is; me too|我也是中文系的学生。|Wǒ yě shì Zhōngwén xì de xuésheng.|I am also a student in the Chinese department.|A curved line hooking outward to link one statement smoothly to another ("also").
文|language; literature; culture|中文|Zhōngwén|Chinese language|我很喜欢学习中文。|Wǒ hěn xǐhuan xuéxí Zhōngwén.|I really like learning the Chinese language.|Intersecting strokes woven together like decorative patterns and written culture.
为|for; because of; in order to|因为|yīnwèi|because|因为下雨，所以我没去。|Yīnwèi xiàyǔ, suǒyǐ wǒ méi qù.|Because it rained, I did not go.|A hand guiding an elephant step by step for a clear purpose.
地|earth; ground; place|地方|dìfang|place; area|这是一个非常美丽的地方。|Zhè shì yí gè fēicháng měilì de dìfang.|This is a very beautiful place.|Rich soil (土) stretching out across the land (也) to form the solid ground.
